# Bank details in a mail (lot A6, 1.75.0)
InboxBankTitle = This email talks of bank details
InboxBankLead = Before any change of bank details, check with a call you make yourself. The signals below help, they do not decide.
InboxBankLeadDanger = Nothing proves this email (sender not authenticated or imitated). Change nothing without a call you make yourself.
InboxBankCallTitle = Call with the numbers of your Dolibarr card:
InboxBankCallWhy = Never with a number written in this email or its signature: a fraudster puts his own there and answers in place of the customer.
InboxBankNoNumber = No number on the card: find it from a safe source (invoice or contract already received, official site), never in this email.
InboxBankNoCard = Sender not attached to a card: find the number of the company from a safe source (invoice or contract already received, official site), never in this email.
InboxBankMobile = mobile
InboxBankSeen = What inbox noticed (%s points of attention)
