InboxReactivityInstantHelp = The changes show at once, through a push service installed beside Dolibarr (section below). Without an answer from it, the lists follow at the rhythm of the fast mode.
InboxReactivityIntervalInstantHelp = Between 3 and 60 seconds. In instant mode: used only when the push service does not answer.
