InboxPushGuideTitle = Installation of Mercure
InboxPushGuideIntro = Mercure keeps the connections of the browsers open and gives them the changes of the lists at once. It is free software (AGPL), installed by the administrator of the server beside Dolibarr. The commands below already hold the address of this Dolibarr.
