InboxPushGuideNginx = Reach the hub from the browsers (nginx)
InboxPushGuideNginxText = The browsers need an address in HTTPS: a name of its own for the hub, the stream without buffer. Never behind the proxy of Apache that serves Dolibarr: each open stream would hold a thread of Apache.
InboxPushGuideThenText = In the section « Push service »: address for the browsers https://push.example.com/.well-known/mercure, address for the server http://127.0.0.1:3001/.well-known/mercure, trusted issuer %s, the two keys of the file. Save, Test, then choose « Instant » above.
